{'symbol': 'FMC', 'date': '2021-12-01 16:30:00', 'title': 'FMC CORPORATION JOINS KEY GLOBAL INITIATIVES TARGETING SUSTAINABLE AGRICULTURE AND FOOD SYSTEMS RESILIENCE', 'text': 'PHILADELPHIA, DEC. 1, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0 FMC CORPORATION\xa0(NYSE: FMC), A LEADING AGRICULTURAL SCIENCES COMPANY, HAS JOINED\xa0OTHER COMPANIES, GOVERNMENTS AND INDUSTRY PARTNERS TO SUPPORT THE AGRICULTURAL INNOVATION MISSION FOR CLIMATE (AIM4C) AND THE COALITION FOR SUSTAINABLE PRODUCTIVITY GROWTH FOR FOOD SECURITY AND RESOURCE CONSERVATION (SPG COALITION). THESE KEY INITIATIVES, SPEARHEADED BY THE USDA, ARE\xa0FOCUSED ON ACCELERATING SUSTAINABLE AGRICULTURE FOR A MORE PRODUCTIVE AND EQUITABLE FUTURE.'}